1.5  Bundled fonts (typst-assets, "fonts" feature)
------------------------------------------------------------------

Enabling the `fonts` feature on the `typst-assets` crate ships a
default font set inside the WebAssembly bundle. Each font carries
its own license, typically the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL) or
the Bitstream Vera license. The authoritative license texts for
these fonts ship inside `typst-assets`; consult that crate's
NOTICE / LICENSE-FONTS file for the exact set bundled at the
linked version (0.14).

If your downstream distribution requires the per-font texts to
be reproduced here, regenerate this NOTICE with `cargo about` or
copy the fonts/ section from the upstream `typst-assets` crate.


